    "title": "Brooke Hogan Says Never Mind, Her Dad's Passing Was Totally Normal After All",
    "text": "Brooke Hogan Says Never Mind, Her Dad’s Passing Was Totally Normal After All\nWell, thank goodness.\nPublished 48 minutes ago in Funny\nIf you’ve been following the news about the late Hulk Hogan, you’ve probably been pulled in all sorts of directions about what exactly happened. First, it was totally normal. Then, it was a mystery that could only be resolved by seeing police bodycam footage. After that, it was allegedly connected to medical malpractice.\nGod, this is so confusing I feel like I’ve been Tombstone’d by the Undertaker!\nFor all those sharing my pain, I have some good news: After a week of saying it wasn’t, Brooke Hogan is now claiming her dad’s end was totally normal.\nSpeaking with TMZ Live, she claims that after seeing the body, everything is “on the up-and-up” and that she doesn’t suspect foul play.\nYep, turns out that if you’re a 71-year-old who’s spent his life being slammed into the ground, crossing the River Styx is just one of those things that can happen!",
